window.products.push({"id":254039,"name":"Fukep Bread Knife, Wide Wavy Edge, 8 inch Ultra Sharp Serrated Knife with Sheath, Carbon Stainless Steel X50Cr15MoV Bread Slicer, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SVJ1xBA-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"8 Inch Professional Serrated Bread Knife with Sheath Advanced manual forging technology, after vacuum heat-treatment and nitrogen cryogenic tempering, makes our knives with 55±2 Rockwell Hardness. The edge is precisely hand sharpened to 13° on one side, making the knife easier to use and easy to sharpen. Ergonomic handle design to keep well balanced and minimized finger fatigue. The meticulously constructed, triple-riveted handle has gone through special treatment, making it impervious to heat, cold, and moisture. Premium Steel The Bread Slicing Knife is made of premium X50Cr15MoV High Carbon Stainless Steel, the carbon content in the steel is about 0.55%, which makes the blade better hardness and ability of resists rust, stain, and holds a sharp edge for a long time. Ultra-sharp Bread Knife The serrated knife's blade has an ultra-sharp serrated edge that grips and effortlessly slices the toughest loaves of bread, to provide a smooth, clean-cut. This knife excels when it's time to delicately slice through three slices of toasted bread piled with crispy bacon, soft tomatoes, lettuce, and meats. Features Net Weight: 214g Total Length: 13\" Length of the blade: 8\" How to use the bread knife Place the blade at a slight angle facing down towards the bread knife, and begin sawing through the bread.  Press down slightly, and then pull the blade back towards yourself.  Use a gentle sawing motion. The sharp, serrated edges will slice through your loaf of bread with minimal force necessary. How to sharpen the serrated bread knife Sharpen the serrated knife on one side only, the serration bevel side. Hold the sharpening rod slightly slanted, and sharpen the knife by laying the sharpening rod in the serrations, tooth after tooth, and moving it up and down. We advise laying the bread knife flat on the edge of a table to avoid accidents.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SVJ1xBA-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fukep","source_asin":"B08MPRGMRH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-254039","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MPRGMRH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MPRGMRH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
