window.products.push({"id":254154,"name":"ulwae Insulated Coffee Mug with Ceramic Coating, 18oz Travel Mug with Leak-proof Lid, Vacuum Double-wall Tumbler, Stainless Steel Thermal Cup for Tea,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51UlYDkf26L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"[High-Quality Materials] This coffee mug is made with food-grade stainless steel, the interior is coated with real ceramic. This carefully designed combination creates a sturdy cup that will last through many uses without discoloration or warping while maintaining a high-quality of taste for your coffee and other beverages. The double-layered walls provide insulation to keep your drinks at your desired temperature for hours. [Perfect for Everyday Use] This Coffee Mug will quickly become your go-to portable cup. It fits in almost any car cup holder for easy commuting. The leak-proof design of the lid and mug make it ideal to take anywhere from the office to a road trip to a weekend at the beach. [Flip Flop Lid] The unique lid provides you with maximum convenience and simplicity. The lid has a traditional click-open coffee cup lid opening for sipping hot and cold beverages. The lid openings have covers for spill-proof travel. [Leakproof & Spillproof] You can put this coffee mug in your bag, purse, or lunch box while on-the-go, and you won’t have to worry about leaks. The lid is constructed specifically to minimize the possibility of leaks and spills. The non-slip pad on the bottom ensures that you can confidently set the mug down on any surface. [Easy to Clean] The coffee cup opens wider at the lid so that you can wash the ceramic interior without any special tools. The internal straw is removable for easy cleaning. You will be amazed at how simple it is to remove and reattach the straw. For best results, hand wash the cup and lid with warm water and mild soap. Let dry completely before storing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51UlYDkf26L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ulwae","source_asin":"B0B53Z6TRX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-254154","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B53Z6TRX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B53Z6TRX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
