window.products.push({"id":254199,"name":"Hip Flask: by Good Whiskey With Stainless Steel Shot Glasses, No Spill Hip Flask Funnel and Gift Box","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EzzLqVdvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Black John & The Good Whiskey Hip Flask Story: I remember when I was growing up my grandfather, was an old Irish blacksmith, Black John with unbelievable skill, and was known around the country for the quality of his work. He loved turning metals into objects of purpose and value, from shoeing horses to creating gates and ploughs. He was a quiet man who lived to a ripe old age, with more children than I have fingers, and who came to life with a glass of whiskey in one hand, and a cigarette in the other, and a sing song was never far away. Generous to a fault, the “Good Whiskey” brand will be something he could relate to. Like us, he would want you to enjoy your whiskey. Special Features: Perfectly crafted hand size hip flask, Wonderful accessories - 2 x shot glasses & no spill funnel complete the five star experience, Premium brand, Holds 6 oz of your favourite spirit or alcoholic, or non-alcoholic beverage, Brighten up any party, BBQ or special occasion with your Hip Flask Gift Box, Stylish, ergonomic curved design, with screw on cap - can never be misplaced, Truly a unisex, one size fits all gift Who Are Good Whiskey Hip Flasks & Gifts? We specialise in premium quality gifts, and your satisfaction is our immediate priority. Box Contains: One x 6 oz Hip Flask, Two x Stainless Steel Shot Glasses, One x No Spill Funnel","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EzzLqVdvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Good Whiskey","source_asin":"B010EJLX6G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-254199","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B010EJLX6G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B010EJLX6G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":254200,"name":"Wulibeey Premium Garlic Press, Stainless Steel & Smooth Texture Garlic Mincer, Comfortable Handle, Easy to Use & Clean, Awesome Garlic Crusher for You","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GBW6-EPqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"😍 Outstanding Design: The ergonomically designed handle is suitable for different hand sizes, and it feels smooth and comfortable to hold. 👍 High Quality: The durable food grade metal and the sturdy construction ensure that this garlic mincer is built to last. ⚡️ Easy to Use: Place garlic clove in the chamber and press the handle, the garlic paste is squeezed out just in a few seconds. 💦 Easy to Clean: Washable and dishwasher safe, simply rinse it under running water after using. 🎉 Necessary for Garlic Lovers: It's time to try this awesome garlic press to prepare garlic efficiently and effortlessly instead of using a knife.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GBW6-EPqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wulibeey","source_asin":"B08YNPXVP3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-254200","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YNPXVP3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YNPXVP3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":254201,"name":"Michel Design Works Turkish Cotton Table Runner, 108-Inch, Merry & Bright","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515TeLhoXKL._AC_.jpg","description":"To create some drama at the dinner table (the good kind), set out these attention-getting Turkish cotton linens from the Deborah Michel Collection. Beautifully made, and backed with fabric so they hold their shape. Available in two lengths: 60 inches and 108 inches. Machine wash cold, gentle cycle. Tumble dry and iron as needed. Michel Design Works was created by Bruce & Deborah Michel in the early 1980s. The first product was an elaborate \"memory book\" called Our Country Diary. Still a favorite today, it is filled with vintage artwork, quirky quotes, notable dates and plenty of room to record all the events of the year. Our Country Diary will become a beautiful record of your family life. When they first created their signature elephant logo, it signified a remembrance of all things special. Although Michel Design Works has greatly expanded into bath & body, home fragrance and decor, when Bruce & Deborah remember and celebrate all of their wonderful customers and the company's history, it is even more fitting today! Whether you are a new or a long-time friend, we welcome you to enjoy the art, lather up with our English soaps, set an elegant table with napkins, candles, plates, and serve ware, and end your day with wonderfully fragrant bubble bath.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515TeLhoXKL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Michel Design Works","source_asin":"B01IYGD9WC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-254201","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01IYGD9WC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01IYGD9WC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
