window.products.push({"id":254248,"name":"Christmas Decorations Animated Musical Santa Claus Decoration, DIY Christmas Tree Hangings Electric Climbing Wearing Mask Ladder Santa Home Christmas ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71itRhMm8+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Christmas Decorations, Electric Santa Clause with Climb Ladder. This cute climbing Santa Claus is beautifully designed, and it creates a picture of Santa Claus climbing a rope ladder with a bag of gifts on his back. Product description 1. Perfect atmosphere It will bring more Christmas atmosphere to your family and friends, and they will feel full of happiness. 2. This electric Santa Claus can climb up and down repeatedly with music. The cute appearance of the climbing ladder Santa Claus ornaments is very popular with children. Santa Claus represents good things and good blessings. 3. Lovely Christmas theme design, add fun to Christmas, light up the festive atmosphere, and make your home more beautiful. The perfect decoration for home, school, store and Christmas party. Product Specifications: Material: Plastic Category: Home decorations Style: Cartoon Santa Features: Cute/ Beautiful/ Wear-resistant/ Beautiful/ Fashionable Applications: Home/ School/ Bar/ Stores/ Shopping Mall Suitable Occasions: Christmas Decoration Power Supply: 2* AA battery( Self-provided, package not included) Size: According to the size provided in the picture Color: Red/ White/ Black/ Green Package: 1*Christmas decoration Warm reminder 1. Please remember that due to the lighting effects, the monitor's brightness / contrast settings / etc's, there will be some slight differences in the color of the pictures and the actual items. Measured by hand, deviations of 1-2 cm are possible. 2. Please feel free to contact us, we provide you with 24 hours service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71itRhMm8+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kolesarl","source_asin":"B09H2Y24WL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-254248","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09H2Y24WL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09H2Y24WL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":254249,"name":"Hot Chocolate Bomb Mold, 2 Packs Silicone Sphere Molds for Cocoa Candy Cake Mousse Jelly Pudding, Round Bomb Mold Non-Stick BPA Free, 6 Large Cavity","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wBtgFtsDL._AC_SL1010_.jpg","description":"How to use: 1.Put the Semicircular silicone molds in boiling water for 5 minutes before using it for the first time to remove the smell of silicone itself (Only the first time). 2.Preparing the necessary material before making a cake, and finishing stirring. 3.For flexible reason, we design the mold a bit soft, so you may easily un-mold.When baking or you need a more sturdy support when transfer or move, you can put the mold in the flat baking tray or another mold. 4.Temperature range from -40℃ to 230℃ 5.After baking, please leave the baking mold cooling for 10 minutes before the mold unloading for the better effect.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wBtgFtsDL._AC_SL1010_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YOOTON","source_asin":"B08RC65HQ4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-254249","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RC65HQ4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RC65HQ4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":254250,"name":"Casper Sleep Soft and Durable Supima Cotton Sheet Set, Twin XL, Cream","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71W4l0LFdgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Before designing our sheets, we had to rethink everything we thought we knew. We learned that a higher thread count doesn’t mean higher quality, you can’t cut corners when it comes to cotton, and the right weave makes a world of difference. Our result? Sheets that are the perfect balance of soft, crisp, and airy. Instead of obsessing over the number of threads, we focused on finding the right thread count for our specific cotton and weave choices. A high thread count sounds fancy, but more threads can actually make sheets heavier and less breathable. We landed on 400 two-ply threads — a modest number that makes a big difference. We chose a lightweight percale weave because it’s proven to last longer and breathe better than any other. It features a classic one-over-one pattern that will give you cool, crisp comfort for nights on end. Supima is one of the longest cotton fibers in the world. It’s 35% longer and 45% stronger than regular cottons, which means the fiber is even softer and more lustrous wash after wash. It’s a big part of what makes the Casper sheets naturally soft. The Supima cotton used in Casper sheets comes from a farm in California’s Central Valley. The Casper sheets are designed in the USA; Spun, woven and sewn in India, and made with Supima cotton from California. These sheets will fit any mattress up to 14 inches high.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71W4l0LFdgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Casper","source_asin":"B07S2B4TB6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-254250","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07S2B4TB6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07S2B4TB6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
