window.products.push({"id":254443,"name":"Wilson Birch Firewood - Seasoned Natural Kiln Dried Fireplace, Fire Pit, Bonfire Logs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715TAioARaL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"White birch firewood provides a low smoke, hot burn with an enchanting blue flame, and subtle fragrance often described as nature’s incense Seasoned birch firewood - from logs harvested from the pristine wilderness of Upper Michigan - is ideal for gathering around an indoor fireplace, hearth, fire pit, or backyard bonfire Firewood undergoes a kiln dry process that wicks away moisture and seasons the wood; this natural product may not match the image identically, and may include a range of sizes, loose bark, chips, and normal debris Includes 1 extra large size box (16-18 in x 12 in x 12 in) natural split and whole seasoned birch firewood, ranging from 1 to 3 inches in diameter Natural wood products are proudly made in the USA, in Michigan's Upper Peninsula","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715TAioARaL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wilson","source_asin":"B0BVWLYQ7J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-254443","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BVWLYQ7J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BVWLYQ7J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":254444,"name":"Esso Gomez Artwork by DawgArt Wood Frame, 16 by 20-Inch, Black Matte","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Cot4xTFXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, matted framed art piece features a colorful portrait of a dog. Alicia VanNoy Call has been working on DawgArt since 2003. She takes her colorful inspiration for her paintings from the Desert Southwest. She works with various rescue and shelter groups by donating artwork to fundraising auctions to promote awareness and direct care for animals in need. Said Alicia, \"DawgArt is meant simply to bring happiness to people and to help us remember our connection with Nature.\" An 11x14 giclee print under acrylic in a 16x20 wood frame. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating museum quality fine art reproductions. This high quality print is matted using black matting and comes in a wood frame. A clear acrylic facing is added to protect the print. The piece is fully assembled by professional framers and comes ready to hang. The black mat allows the image to really stand out, making it a great addition to any space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Cot4xTFXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00PWBQK3I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-254444","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00PWBQK3I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00PWBQK3I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":254445,"name":"Warmhoming Multipurpose Kitchen Shears with 5 Stainless Steel Blades and Cleaning Comb (Green)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Nh8CyhAqL._AC_.jpg","description":"Top 7 Reasons For Buying Warmhoming Herb Scissors/ Multipurpose Kitchen Shears/ Herb Scissors Stainless Steel with 5 Blades and Cleaning Comb: 1. Best Kitchen Gadget Ever Say good-bye to tedious cutting and chopping. Put your knives away! Snip herbs directly onto plates and pans with this easy to use herb kitchen scissor. Garnish your meals like a pro! And do it fast-keeping flavors crisp and clean, all while preserving healthy benefits of fresh herbs. 2. Easy To Clean Ideal for chopping, cutting and mincing herbs fast and easy! Made with dishwasher safe material and comes with a FREE cleaning comb. After use one quick swipe with the cleaning comb to the end of the blade, pushes sticky clinging herbs right off. Just rinse the blades and wash it in your dishwasher ready for next use. 3. Top Quality 100%, Rust Free and Durable We use 100% premium quality rust free STAINLESS STEEL material in our herb scissors that are built to last. 4. Ergonomic Design & Longer Lasting Crafted with an award winning design keeping your comfort and usage in mind, the soft 2 layered silicon plastic handle makes comfortable for fingers while making herb cutting fun. 5. Best For Multi Purpose Use Great kitchen tool for garnishing your dishes. Works great with scallion, basil, mint, dill, parsley, thyme, chives, fennel and many more. It can also be used for arts & crafts making confetti, as well as quick paper shredding at home or office. 6. Friendly Customer Service Always here to help, feel free to email or call with any questions or concerns. 7. 100% Money Back Guarantee BUY with Full confidence and “Peace Of Mind”, if you're not 100% satisfied send it back for a Refund within 90 Days of purchase.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Nh8CyhAqL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Warmhoming","source_asin":"B00GZ0MJ6W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-254445","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00GZ0MJ6W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00GZ0MJ6W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":254446,"name":"Carttiya Blackout Curtains 84 Inch for Bedroom, Thermal Insulated Room Darkening Curtains with Grommets, Window Curtain Panels/Drapes for Living Room ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IC33ejmqS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Package Includes: 2 blackout curtain panels per package. Each window curtains panel measures 42\" wide x 84\" long. 84\" wide X 84\" long in total. Carttiya room darkening curtains has 8 silver metal grommets on the top of the curtains(1.6-inch inner diameter for each grommet), which fits well with standard or decorative curtain rods for easy installation and sliding. Material & Workmanship: Our room darkening curtains 84 inches long are made of 100% high-quality durable polyester, drapery, super soft to the touch and free from chemical smell. These black blackout curtains 2 panel are neatly trimmed and wrinkle free, with the same color on both sides. Multi-function: Made of super soft triple-weave fabric, our blackout curtains for bedroom can block out 85%-99% sunlight and harmful UV ray to protect furniture and floors from sun damage and fading. And these short bedroom curtains are thermal insulated, soundproof, fade-resistant, energy-efficient and privacy protection, perfect choice for people who looking for a comfortable working, sleeping or entertaining environment. Easy Care: These living room curtains 84 length can be machine washable with cold water. Bleaching is not recommended. Warm iron or steam iron on the backside of thermal curtains, and tumble dry at low temperatures. Perfect room darkening curtains for living room, bedroom, kids room or nursery room, boys/girls bedroom window, guestrooms, lobby, shower, office, indoor window, outdoor terrace, garden and so on. Wide Range Application: These window curtain panels can be perfectly matched with most of the furniture, creating a clean, warm and comfortable atmosphere for your bedroom, living room, kitchen, bathroom, student dormitory and other spaces. Nice gift for late sleepers, shift workers, kids, girls, boys, seniors, infants, parents, students, computer operators, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IC33ejmqS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Carttiya","source_asin":"B08XZ294YH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-254446","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XZ294YH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XZ294YH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":254447,"name":"Selo LLC 90 pcs Natural Pampas Grass Dried - 30 pcs Reed Grass, 20 White Pampas Grass, 20 Natural Color Pampas & 20 Bunny Tails. Home Decor, Wedding D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715U-p-0C1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【What You Will Get 】Natural pampas grass for decoration, weddings, and gifts. Come with 30 reed grass, 20 white grass, 20 natural colors, and 20 bunny tail to equal 90 pieces in a pack. These dried natural pampas have been selected by hand to ensure quality in each steam. 【Premium Quality 】Our pampas grass are 100 % natural, picked by farmers and all followers are naturally dried and soft touch. Dried pampas grass can last for long time and it doesn’t require good care. A perfect decoration for any season. 【How to Get your Pampas Ready】Take them out of the box, give them a gentle shake, place them under the sun for a few hours to fluff, or use a hair dryer to speed up the process, assemble them how you wish in a vase, and enjoy. For maintenance, use hair sprays every six months to avoid shedding. 【Best Decoration & Ideal Gift】Pampas is a great way to add nature into any atmosphere. By placing the pampas in a lovely vase or glass jar for a boho décor in the home, venue, or to give as a gift for different occasions such as birthday, Valentine's Day, women's day, Easter, Mother's Day, Christmas, wedding, or as a thank you 【Satisfaction Guarantee】We believe in the quality of our pampas grass and satisfaction of our customer is our top priority, if you have any questions about the products. Please do not hesitate to contact us","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715U-p-0C1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Selo LLC","source_asin":"B0B2LF2WBQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-254447","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2LF2WBQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2LF2WBQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
