window.products.push({"id":254454,"name":"KitchenAid Artisan 5-Quart Stand Mixers (YELLOW CITRUS)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AHlyt2N8L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"KitchenAid's Artisan stand mixer is a substantial piece of equipment: 325 watts of mixing power make child's play of creaming butter, kneading dough, and whipping cream. The kid in you will appreciate how quick and easy it is to mix up a batch of cookie dough. This model comes with three attachments: a flat beater for making batter, meat loaf, and all textures in-between; a wire whip for egg whites, mayonnaise, and more air-infused creations; and a hook for mixing and kneading yeast doughs. All three are solidly constructed and easily secured to the beater shaft with a simple twist. This model also includes a pouring shield for guiding ingredients to their proper destination, and the bowl itself locks tight to the base. Standing about 15 inches high, jutting out a foot, and weighing more than a grown woman's bowling ball, this stand mixer isn't the sort of appliance you'll wipe down and put away. Better to find a square foot of free counter space for easy access; besides, this machine is as pretty as it is rugged--you'll want to show it off. --Betsy Danheim","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AHlyt2N8L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KitchenAid","source_asin":"B00CJJ9JFM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-254454","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00CJJ9JFM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00CJJ9JFM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":254455,"name":"Zhung Ree Sofa Slipcover,1 Piece Easy Fitted Sofa Couch Cover Universal High Stretchable Durable Furniture Protector with Skirt Country Style,Free 2-P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XdIvLJk-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Polyester,spandex PREMIUM FABRIC: Crafted from 95% polyester and 5% spandex thick jacquard fabric, makes sofa slipcover more resilient and durable. Fit for most types of couches such as loveseat sofa, barrel chair,  T-cushion sofa, leather sofa and so on. Use unique dyeing technology to keep the color unchanged after repeated washing. AVAILABLE SIZES: 1 PIECE sofa slipcover and 2pcs Pillow Cases,  We offer suitable sofa covers in 4 sizes: Small size (33-53 inches wide), Medium size (57-70 inches wide), Large size (72-92 inches wide), and X-Large size (94-112 inches wide). Please contact us if you have questions, we are willing to assist you. FULL PROTECTION: The soft, bouncy and comfortable sofa slipcover can prevent your sofa from accidental spills, pet scratches, daily stains and tears. Stretch fabric provides all-round protection, with thick elastic loops sewn at the bottom to securely attach to each edge, and ensure the slipcover stay in place firmly. [Easy fit] Our slipcovers for sofa has excellent flexibility.It is easy to fit various kinds of couches (Pls measure the size in advance according to the dimension drawings on the picture.) Anti-slip foam roller prevents the couch covers for sofa slipping off.Elastic cord can easily adjust the position of the sofa slipcovers skirt. CLEANING TIPS: Easy to care and maintain, machine washable in cold water, mild detergent, gentle cycle, tumble dry low. Please do not bleach, do not iron. High quality materials are durable for repeated cleaning, keep soft touch and high elasticity after time, refresh your sofa slipcover?s appearance and wrinkle free.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XdIvLJk-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zhung Ree","source_asin":"B08JM198Z8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-254455","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JM198Z8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JM198Z8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
