window.products.push({"id":254498,"name":"3-in-1 Portable Air Conditioner & Evaporative Ice Cooler Fan & Ion Air Purifier, 3 Wind Speed, 90° Oscillation, 4 Caster, 12H Timer and Remote Control","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RFKDgM8FS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cooling Fan Working & Design : Innovative cooling technology with quiet high speed spinning fan along with plant fiber curtain to release ice water into fresh cold and moist wind, and the biggest air outlet window could maximize the air stream volume. To cool and humidify your surrounding off in the most comfortable and fastest way. No more hot and dry in this summer. This portable air cooler can be used as a tower fan without water running. 90° Oscillation & 360° Universal Wheels: The portable air conditioner has 4 universal wheels which allows you easily take it to any rooms. And the wheels are easy to remove, no extra installation needed, plug and play. The inner blades are designed with 90° swing automatically to cool down your room evenly, moreover, you can manually adjust the blowing direction vertically in 120° freely. 3 Modes & 3 Wind Speed & Remote & Timer : The smart evaporative air cooler can quickly cool air with its high efficiency motor. With a whole range of options like High-Med-Low fan and Sleep/Normal/Cool mode, better for small and medium spaces like an atrium, living room, bedroom, kitchen, den, garage and office. Set the 1-12 hrs timer function, no worry about being cold at night. And remote control offers you totally peace and enjoy without getting up from bed. Large Capacity & 2 Ice Crystal Boxes & Health ION : 1 Gallon big capacity water reservoir allows this evaporative cooler fan run long time. And it also come with 2 ice boxes. Press the ‘COLD’ button for powerful cool, loading it up with ice cubes and ice packs for best use! By press the \"ION\" button, it can emits negative ions to neutralize the potentially harmful positive ions that emit from electronic devices like smartphones, televisions, radios and more. 3-Minutes Delayed Turn Off Function: When you wanna turn off the fan, the fan will not immediately stop running and will wait 3 mins to stop. Due to the curtain paper is wet at that time, in order to extend its service life, we set a delayed turn off function to protect your machine. In addition, we provide a one-year warranty, so you don’t need to worry about after-sales issues. Note: It‘ll be cooler than a traditional fan, but it can't be compared with an air conditioner, that means it can't be as cool as an air conditioner. Air conditioning is a chemical cooling, and our cooler fan can only be cooled by evaporating water and ice.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RFKDgM8FS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YOUICHIC","source_asin":"B0922GWL33","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-254498","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0922GWL33","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0922GWL33","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
