window.products.push({"id":254626,"name":"SearchI Dining Bench Cover, Stretch Washable Upholstered Bench Slipcover, Jacquard Bench Seat Protector, Rectangle Bench Covers for Dining Room, Bedro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51vZ3pT-YqL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【High-quality Material】 The stretch bench cover is made of 92% polyester fiber and 8% spandex. The high quality fabric is durable comfortable and anti-wrinkle. The jacquard pattern makes the kitchen bench cover more slip resistant than the ordinary bench cover. 【Perfect Protection】 With our dining bench covers, your beloved bench chairs will better withstand the scrapes and abrasions of daily use. Surely, The dining chair slipcovers can also protect your chairs from stains, dirt, bites and hairs of pets. They are great choices for homes with children, cats and dogs. It's a perfect synergy of protection and beauty. 【One Size Fit Most】 The kitchen bench cover is available in a variety of colors, suitable for most conventional upholstered benches with a length of 42-54in, a width of 14-18in, and a height of 3-4.7in . Since the size of the elastic chair cover is measured manually, there will be an error of about 0.5in. Please measure the size of the chair before purchasing. 【Widely Application】With these bench covers, you can give your beloved upholstered bench chair a whole new lease of life with very little cost or effort. They come in vivid colors and exquisite patterns, so you can match them with other furniture. They are suitable for many occasions, such as dining room, living room, bedroom and so on. 【Easy to install and wash】Designed with an elastic band and 4 straps with splicing buckles, the dining room bench cover can stay firmly in place without shifting or moving. You only need to slide the jacquard bench cover over the bench to fix and fasten it. Machine wash in cold water and gentle cycle, tumble dry low, do not iron and bleach.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51vZ3pT-YqL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SearchI","source_asin":"B0995SQ3WH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-254626","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0995SQ3WH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0995SQ3WH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
