window.products.push({"id":254862,"name":"Liquid Paraffin Lamp Oil - Half-Liter (500mL) - Smokeless, Odorless, Ultra Clean Burning Fuel for Indoor and Outdoor Use (Clear)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51jftV9FnbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A PREMIUM PRODUCT FOR SAFER FLAMES This Paraffin Lamp Oil by The Dreidel Company is processed, refined and distilled more than traditional kerosene to produce a light source suitable for both indoor and outdoor use. Able to be used with any Lamp Oil wick (Cotton or Fiberglass) , this oil fuels a smokeless, odorless flame. Now you can kindle your lights, light your lanterns and more without the soot or strong, unpleasant odor of kerosene. VERSATILE USE While gentle for indoor and home use, The Dreidel Company's Paraffin Lamp Oil is also powerful for outdoor venues. Light your tiki torches with this oil for outdoor barbecues and pool parties. Create beautiful, glowing centerpieces for weddings and fancy events. Light the pathway to an outdoor wedding canopy with a series of flames fueled by this oil. Illuminate restaurant tables and buffet counters for a romantic touch. Keep a bottle of The Dreidel Company's Paraffin Lamp Oil in store and be prepared for any power outage. Allowing you to light oil lamps and lanterns. LIGHT UP IN STYLE The Dreidel Company's Paraffin Lamp Oil comes in an assortment of six different colors so you can customize your glow to suit your taste.  How to Achieve the Best Performance  Don't Mix Different Fuels. Remove old residual fuel from the fuel reservoir before filling with Fuel. You certainly don't want to mix fuels together. Mixing fuels will change their burning properties and may cause excessive smoke.  Use a Clean, Uncontaminated Lamp Oil Wick (cotton or Fiberglass). The wick is the delivery vehicle for the fuel. If the wick is contaminated with old fuel or water, it will not perform properly.  Keep the Wick Height to a Minimum which Inhibits Smoking and Conserves Fuel. The wick should be a","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51jftV9FnbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Dreidel Company","source_asin":"B0B5B82KLL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-254862","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5B82KLL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5B82KLL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":254863,"name":"Umami Glass Water Bottle With Tea Infuser And Non Slip Sleeve. Double Wall Borosilicate. Travel Tumbler With Bamboo Lid. 17oz. Design: Classic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51bRhfo-cnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🤸TAKE ME ANYWHERE - It's really 100% leakproof: upside down, or shaken around, the glass water bottle's lid fits snugly and will keep your bag safe and dry! ☕ONE BOTTLE MANY USES - Use the water bottle to infuse aromatic loose leaf tea, fresh fruit, for juice, or even brew coffee. The strainer with a tiny mesh will keep everything in place and will allow you to enjoy your perfectly tailored drink. 🧊ICED or HOT - Whether you're a hot tea lover or in need of ice-cold fruit water, this cute water bottle is for you! The double wall and insulation sleeve will allow you to enjoy your drink at the perfect temperature for longer. 📏THE PERFECT SIZE - This half liter water bottle (16 oz) is great for keeping you hydrated without being bulky and heavy. The travel mug fits perfectly in a car cup holder so it can keep up with you all-day. 🚿EASY TO CLEAN & USE - The borosilicate glass is dishwasher safe and super easy to keep sparkling clean. The tea infuser bottle is also easy to take apart & put back together, you can keep the strainer in or take it out when your tea is perfect. 🌎GOOD FOR THE PLANET - Reduce single-use plastics with this reusable glass water bottle It's fully recyclable too! Umami is good for you and the planet 🍃STAY HEALTHY - Stay hydrated and make sure your drinks are safe and tasty. The tea tumbler is made of the highest quality borosilicate glass and stainless steel which means that it's 100% non-toxic and BPA-free. 🎁ULTIMATE GIFT - The Umami tea infuser mug is the perfect gift for anyone trying to stay healthy and hydrated in today's busy world! Stylish and practical your loved ones will love it. 🎨BEAUTIFUL DESIGN - Feast your eyes on this Japanese design large water bottle. The glass design pairs perfectly with the bamboo lid. Elevate your drink experience with Umami.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51bRhfo-cnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Umami","source_asin":"B0C3TG62WP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-254863","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3TG62WP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3TG62WP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
