window.products.push({"id":254898,"name":"12 INCH Owl Kachina","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":125.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GI9kHKzDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The term Kachina refers to a masked and costumed dancer representing various spiritual and natural aspects of life. Kachina dolls have been made for centuries by different tribes for use in traditional ceremonies. They are guardians, messengers, bestow blessings and nurture life. Originally, Kachina dolls were carved and given to the women and children of the tribe but now are made for all to enjoy. A beautiful addition to any collection or thoughtful gift. This purchase allows Native Americans to continue to be employed in their trade. This Kachina is made with real rabbit fur making the color difficult to be consistent. Each one is handmade and in most cases one of a kind.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GI9kHKzDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kachina Country USA","source_asin":"B01MG5BX1V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-254898","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MG5BX1V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MG5BX1V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":254899,"name":"Poetic Wanderlust By Tracy Porter PQW2114KG-1100 Printed Velvet Quilt, King, Fiona","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1pi1XCfR2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Tracy Porter layers patterns, colors, and illustrations to build enchanting designs, whose beauty is irresistible. With an infinite art archive at her fingertips, Tracy takes vintage patterns and digitally blends them with her unmistakable style. The unconventional fusion of bohemian style and elegance allows Tracy's designs to flow seamlessly into any home. The Poetic Wanderlust collection by Tracy Porter embodies a romantic spirit that's tempered with sophistication. Embrace an item from the Poetic Wanderlust collection and bring a unique treasure that speaks to every person and every home's style. Tracy's painterly collages harmonize colors and imagery. The range of inspiration that spurs her designs is unquantifiable; paisley, flowers, ikat, fleur de lis, leaves, animal prints, abstracts, classic meanders, and tribal patterns are just the tip of the iceberg. Tracy also quotes her own home life as a continuous source of inspiration. Modern homes, traditional homes, and homes that defy definition, all find a place for Tracy's artwork. Whether you're adding more vibrant colors or bringing in an accent piece that makes a statement, you'll want these quilts, comforters, pillows, and other pieces of decor into your home. The range of Tracy Porter fans/followers prove how much her style engages peoples of all ages. She has made appearances on Oprah, HGTV and E!Style. Her work has been featured in O, House Beautiful, ELLE, Traditional Home, Better Home & Gardens, Family Circle and many others. Tracy has also written many lifestyle books, is a contributing editor to multiple blogs, and won the Better Homes & Gardens \"Better By Design\" award.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1pi1XCfR2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Poetic Wanderlust By Tracy Porter","source_asin":"B076KQPW72","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-254899","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076KQPW72","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076KQPW72","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":254900,"name":"Alarm Clock With USB C Port, 2 AC Outlets and 4 USB Ports Alarm Clock Charging Station, Electronic Alarm Clock Charger for Bedroom Office Hotel Travel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zufsYNHUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Product information】： 2 AC Outlets 2 AC Outlets 1X USB-A Ports 1X USB-A Ports 3X USB-A Ports 3X USB-A Ports Input voltage : AC100-250V/50-60HZ Input voltage : AC100-250V/50-60HZ Rated power : 1200W/10A Rated power : 1200W/10A USB Output: DC 5V 3.4A Each Port USB Output: DC 5V 3.4A Each Port PD Outlput: 5V/3.4A PD Outlput: 5V/3.4A Intelligent identification, automatic shunt Intelligent identification, automatic shunt 【How to set the time】: Long press the \"ALARM CLOCK\" button to adjust the clock then use the \"UP/DOWN\" buttons to change the time, short pressing the \"ALARM CLOCK\" to set and exit. Make sure you have the correct DST setting (It have \"AM\" and \"PM\" sign at the left ). This clock default setting is 6am, the clock will returns to default if power is interrupted. 【How to set the alarm】: Short press the \"ALARM CLOCK\" button to set alarm time then use the \"UP/DOWN\" buttons to adjust alarm time, short pressing the \"ALARM CLOCK\" to set and exit. 【How to set Fahrenheit】: Short press the “DOWN” button to switch between Celsius/Fahrenheit display mode. 【How to adjust screen backlight】: Single press \" SNOOZE / DIMMER \" to adjust the backlight brightness : three levels of brightness- > two levels of brightness - one level of brightness-off- > one level of brightness- > two levels of brightness -levels of brightness- > cycle. 【How to keep time memory】:The clock does not keep memory; if power is interrupted (or turn off clock), the clock returns to default time. For ensure accurate time-keeping during power disconnection, we suggest you put the battery into the clock. 2 * AAA Battery (NOT INCLUDED).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zufsYNHUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kungfuking","source_asin":"B09Q5D6ZTK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-254900","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Q5D6ZTK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Q5D6ZTK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
