window.products.push({"id":254911,"name":"DRAGONN 10 Piece Airtight Food Storage Container Set with Labels, Pantry Organization and Storage, Keeps Food Fresh, Big Sizes Included, Durable, BPA ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713q4c2H+8L._AC_SL1399_.jpg","description":"Best Range of Sizes - No more plastic storage container sets that only have a bunch of small canisters, the Dragonn pantry storage set has the perfect combination of small, medium, and large sizes! Secure Sealing - Each container features an airtight locking system resulting in a watertight and airtight seal. These plastic storage containers are the perfect solution for keeping ingredients and bulk foods fresh, dry, and completely sealed. Easy to Clean - Simply remove the silicone attached along the lids of each container, and hand wash to clean. Re-wrap the silicone around the lid again, and it's ready to go! Versatile - This set contains 10 Containers that are ideal for storing a variety of dry foods including flours, sugars, spaghetti, pasta, coffee, snack mix, nuts, candy, and spices. Premium Quality - Made of high quality, durable, BPA-Free plastic to protect your food while you enjoy an organized kitchen!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713q4c2H+8L._AC_SL1399_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DRAGONN","source_asin":"B07ZPCMJ14","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-254911","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZPCMJ14","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZPCMJ14","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":254912,"name":"CHEF CHIFFON All-In-One Kitchen Manual Hand Operated Food Processor Prep Machine - Salad Spinner, Mixer, Beater, Blend, Chop, Slice, Shred, Julienne, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MzLj+fn0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Easy to use – this all-in-one food processor is a specially designed machine that allows you to cut, slice, chop, grate, mix and store almost any kind of vegetable, cheese, or meat, with speed and precision. Cut preparation time - it can turn food preparation from a time consuming nightmare into any foodies dream come true. From apples to zucchini or salsa to salami, it can do it all slicing, chopping, grating, mincing - put the bowl onto the suction base and twist it clockwise to lock them together. Attach the lid and insert the desired attachment, ensuring that it follows the contours of the lid. Use the safety holder to protect your hands when slicing and grating. Spinning & blending - put the bowl onto the suction base and twist it clockwise to lock them together. Put the desired attachment onto the center spike of the bowl, then add ingredients. Place the lid on the bowl, ensuring that it locks securely. Insert the handle into the lid and rotate it clockwise. Egg separator - secure the bowl to the suction base. Put the desired attachment onto the center spike of the bowl, then add any desired ingredients. Place the lid on the bowl, ensuring that it locks securely. Carefully crack an egg and place it on the egg separator allowing the egg white to run into the bow. Slide the egg separator backwards to remove it and discard the egg yolk as desired. Replace the egg separator before mixing. Easy to clean - it is simple and easy to use and all parts are dishwasher safe. Package includes: slicing, chopping, and grating inserts spinning tri-blade chopper salad spinning basket egg separator air tight lid for instant food storage.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MzLj+fn0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHEF CHIFFON","source_asin":"B00QG8F44M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-254912","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00QG8F44M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00QG8F44M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
