window.products.push({"id":254982,"name":"Villeroy & Boch New Wave Square Platter, 13.25 in, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":48.65,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21ANr7iSInL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Product Description Serve and enjoy with the contemporary new wave: culinary delicacies are served in style on the square platter. The size is ideal for serving various delicacies such as meat, fish or cheese and the slightly raised edge allows a safe and clean serving. With its curved lines, The platter becomes a real eye-catcher. It is also suitable for use when catering: the plate is stackable, has shock and impact resistant edges and the porcelain is dishwasher safe. Amazon.com A truly unique dinnerware pattern, New Wave is part of Villeroy & Boch's Metropolitan collection. Ultra chic and contemporary, each piece incorporates flowing lines, curving edges, and an exceptionally fun design. Lacking any decorative elements, the milky white china speaks for itself, while also highlighting the food or beverage intended for the individual item. Sharp corners give way to wavy sides that lift and turn like the sea, and many pieces in the line fit together in a complementary fashion. A well-defined rim frames the serving area of the New Wave square platter. Measuring 13-1/4 inches on each side, the aesthetic curves of the platter create a feeling of movement when viewed from all angles. Refreshingly distinct, this wonderfully shaped tableware piece has a unique flair that brings distinction to any meal. Crafted from vitrified porcelain with a chip-resistant glaze to ensure durability, all Villeroy & Boch tableware pieces are resilient enough to be placed in the dishwasher and microwave. --Lea Werbel","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21ANr7iSInL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Villeroy & Boch","source_asin":"B08Z3FWFV1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-254982","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Z3FWFV1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Z3FWFV1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
