window.products.push({"id":254996,"name":"SOLIDPIN USB Motion Sensor Rechargeable 20 Bright LED Night Light Bar, DIY Stick-on Anywhere 3 Modes Portable Lamp with Magnetic Strip for Under Cabin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/419IDCM4eML._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Natural Life, Natural Lights The LED Light is the upgraded version of USB406 motion sensor light, Using both infrared (PIR) technology to detect body heat and the human motion sensor (within 3m), the LED light Wireless Motion Sensor Light turns on or off based on occupancy and ambient light levels. It is designed to substitute a standard light switch and built for convenience and personal safety in dark areas. It has a built-in rechargeable battery via micro USB. It is ideal for corridors, cabinets, workshops, basements, indoor garages, stairwells, doorways, closets, and other dark places in your home and shed. Specifications: Sensitivity: 3m/10ft Sensor Range: 120 degrees  LED Qty: 20 LEDs LED life: 50,000 hours or more Battery: built-in 3.7V 600 mAh li-ion battery Material: Aluminum+ABS Size: 37cmx3cm/ 14.6x1.2 inch  Light weight: 193g Output power: 1.5W Luminous Flux: 150 lumen Here are some instructions for your reference: 1. The motion sensor night light will auto illuminate when someone gets close to the sensor in enough DARK environment(as it is equipped with a light sensor) If the surrounding environment is too bright, it will not work perfectly. 2. If the light continue detecting motion, it will keep lighting (which seems \"never\" turn off), it will turn off in 30s after no motion be detected. 3. Pls kindly check the location you install the light, if there is any barrier block the sensing range, the motion sensor function will not work well. 5. Don't put the motion activated LED night lights too close. The light of one night light may cause the other not light up if they are too close.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/419IDCM4eML._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Solidpin","source_asin":"B07231VBVW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-254996","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07231VBVW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07231VBVW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":254997,"name":"SANJIANKER XB-EC06 14 Egg Capacity Egg Cooker,350W Electric Egg Maker,Egg Steamer,Egg Boiler,Egg Cooker With Automatic Shut Off, Egg Cooker with Egg P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515RAlnAEyL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"SANJIANKER Stainless Steel Egg Boiler, Poacher, Steamer & Omelette Maker Enabling you to cook eggs more swiftly, more safely and more energy efficiently than ever before, SANJIANKER's new gadget - the electric egg cooker - is a must-have accessory for any kitchen! Energy Efficient Design A major benefit of the egg cooker is its low carbon footprint. It uses a fraction of the water of a standard saucepan, but cooks your eggs just as swiftly - ensuring you have delicious breakfast eggs every morning without fail! It is also much more consistent than a conventional saucepan: a handy guide is included with the SANJIANKER egg boiler which lets you know exactly how much water to use, and how long to leave your eggs in, to ensure that they are soft, hard or medium boiled! Extremely Versatile Accessory The stainless steel steamer isn't just great for eggs; both poach and steam settings work just as well on vegetables! This makes it the perfect accessory to use whether you're steaming broccoli and carrots or just looking to save a bit of extra room in your oven! Stylish, Ergonomic Design The usefulness of the SANJIANKER egg cooker is rounded out by its stylish, compact design. The modular design not only ensures maximum energy efficiency, it also allows you to wash the top, shelf and body of the gadget separately - ideal for easy clean-up after use! Specifications: Egg Cooker Material: food grade PP plastic and stainless steel Egg Cooker Size: 173×230cm(68. 11\"×90. 55\") Egg Cooker Power: 350W Egg Cooker Voltage: 120V Package Includes: 1 x Egg Cooker 1 x Electric User Manual 1 x water Measuring cup 1 x Egg piercer Egg Cooking Tips For best results, use room temperature eggs - simply remove from your fridge 10-15mins before you want to cook. For fast peeling, start peeling from the end of the egg, not the side.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515RAlnAEyL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SANJIANKER","source_asin":"B09BCZPDNJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-254997","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BCZPDNJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BCZPDNJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
